A part whose number is 0, such as 0s or the 0m of 1h0m, is an error.

--- c/duration.c
-        const char *found = strchr(UNITS, *p);
+        if (number == 0) return false;  // a part that is 0
+        const char *found = strchr(UNITS, *p);
